@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: Reference / design method. Native Git/OO/data notation illustration, not a commitment to advanced product features.
title Levels of abstraction
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

rectangle "System\nActors, capabilities, external boundaries" as S
rectangle "Component / module\nPresentation owner and public contracts" as C
rectangle "Class / object\nPublishRevisionHandler, ResumeDraft, PublicationStore" as O
rectangle "Method / algorithm\nhandle(intent): guards, snapshot, coherent commit, outcome" as M
S --> C : decompose responsibility
C --> O : allocate collaboration
O --> M : define operation behavior
note bottom of M
 Refinement is not automatic 1:1 mapping.
 A domain entity is not automatically a table or service.
end note

@enduml
